1
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:07,220
你弟弟的午餐装好了
Okay, your brother's lunch is packed.

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,300
你的午餐自己买
You're buying your own lunch.

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,300
卢克 艾丽克斯 快点 出发了
Luke, Alex, come on. Let's go.

4
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,860
他来了 最后一次夏日握手
There he is. Last chance for the summer handshake.

5
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:18,460
老爸
Dad.

6
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,300
继续啊 我们只做了一半
Come on. We're only halfway done.

7
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,260
我需要帮忙
I need help.

8
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,720
我本来该写暑假日记的 今天就得交了
I was supposed to keep a journal all summer. It's due today.

9
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,360
开学第一天就落后了
Wow, first day of school and you're already behind?

10
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,160
我死定了
I'm dead.

11
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,340
好吧 说说看你还差多少
All right. Tell me how far you've gotten.

12
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:32,600
好吧
Okay.

13
00:00:32,666 --> 00:00:35,586
"6月21日 找到一根棍子"
"June 21. Found a stick."

14
00:00:35,586 --> 00:00:38,932
"6月22日" 没了
"June 22." That's it.

15
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,160
-没了 -那棍子真的很赞
- That's it? - It was a really cool stick.

16
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,640
他说的没错 长得就跟蛇一样
He's right. It looked like a snake.

17
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,540
每天早上送大家出门
Getting everybody out of the house in the morning

18
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,480
可不是件省心的事
can be really tough,

19
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:48,719
尤其是开学第一天
especially the first day of school.

20
00:00:48,719 --> 00:00:49,912
从我俩7点起床的那一刻开始
From the minute we get up at 7:00

21
00:00:49,912 --> 00:00:52,990
到把他们送进学校 就没一刻休息过
till we drop 'em off at school, it is go, go, go.

22
00:00:53,151 --> 00:00:54,956
我6点就起来了
I get up at 6:00.

23
00:00:55,557 --> 00:00:56,931
我还5点起床呢
I get up at 5:00.

24
00:00:57,563 --> 00:00:59,458
说真的 我6点就起了
Seriously. I get up at 6:00.

25
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:02,040
原来是你啊 我还以为是浣熊进来了呢
That's you? I thought we had a raccoon.

26
00:01:03,167 --> 00:01:06,823
真不敢相信我的宝贝都上5年级了
I can't believe my little boy is going into the fifth grade.

27
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,900
我还记得他用小手紧握着我手指
He used to hold my finger with his little hand

28
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:11,660
一双大眼望着我的样子呢
and look at me with those big eyes.

29
00:01:12,106 --> 00:01:14,316
那是我的小宝贝啊 杰
Mi nio pequeo, Jay.

30
00:01:14,742 --> 00:01:15,897
是啊 孩子总会长大
Yup, they grow up.

31
00:01:16,662 --> 00:01:18,241
快点 曼尼 出发了
Come on, Manny. Let's get going.

32
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:21,280
我的发型如何
How's my hair?

33
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,640
等等 你穿的是个什么玩意儿
Hold on. What are you wearing there?

34
00:01:25,189 --> 00:01:27,100
跟圣诞树罩子一样
That looks like an old Christmas tree skirt.

35
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:29,020
这是一件传统的哥伦比亚斗篷
It's a traditional Colombian poncho.

36
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,260
我想让新同学知道
I want my new classmates to know

37
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:32,440
我对我的老祖先有多么自豪
I'm proud of my heritage.

38
00:01:33,105 --> 00:01:35,798
我觉得你帅呆了 小宝贝
I think you look very handsome. Lindo.

39
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,521
真的吗 是我载他去学校呢
Oh, really? Am I driving him to school

40
00:01:37,521 --> 00:01:38,926
还是他自己骑驴去
or is he gonna ride his burro?

41
00:01:41,260 --> 00:01:44,040
*你是个可爱派 没错 就是你*
*You are a cutie pie, yes, you are*

42
00:01:44,340 --> 00:01:45,779
*你是个可爱派*
*You are a cutie pie*

43
00:01:45,779 --> 00:01:47,540
你还在装那些幼儿防护设备吗
Are you still baby-proofing?

44
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:49,180
我们家到处都是尖角
Everything we own is pointy.

45
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:51,760
我女儿怎么一身唐娜·莎曼的打扮
Why is our daughter dressed like Donna Summer?

46
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:52,839
她才不是唐娜·莎曼
She is not Donna Summer.

47
00:01:52,839 --> 00:01:55,584
明明是黄金岁月时期的戴安娜·罗斯
Clearly she's Diana Ross from the R.C.A. Years.

48
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,600
你说爹地怎么没看出来呢
How is daddy not seeing that?

49
00:01:57,900 --> 00:01:59,300
我还以为你已经玩腻了呢
I really thought you were done with this.

50
00:01:59,420 --> 00:02:01,120
我可没这么说
I made no such promises.

51
00:02:01,458 --> 00:02:04,616
-我算得上是个摄影爱好者 -对
- I guess I'm somewhat of a shutterbug. - Yes.

52
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:07,660
我的模特新宠嘛 当然就是莉莉了
And my new favorite model, of course, is Lily.

53
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:10,020
我刚刚替莉莉拍完一整套
I just completed a series of photographs

54
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:12,120
流行偶像模仿写真照
of her dressed as various pop icons.

55
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:13,041
比如说
Let's see.

56
00:02:13,041 --> 00:02:15,150
我们拍模仿过奧莉维亚·纽顿·约翰
I've done Olivia Newton-John.

57
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:18,220
和出道早期的麦当娜
I've done Madonna, the early years,

58
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,260
史提夫·汪达
Stevie Wonder-

59
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,720
对 有时候莉莉换衣服比雪儿还勤
Yeah, there are days when Lily has more costume changes than Cher.

60
00:02:24,296 --> 00:02:26,060
雪儿 我怎么把她给忘了
Cher! How could I forget Cher?

61
00:02:26,060 --> 00:02:26,920
真是羞愧啊
That's embarrassing.

62
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:27,920
你只为这个羞愧吗
That's embarrassing?

63
00:02:43,945 --> 00:02:45,273
宝贝 你是要搬出去吗
Honey, you moving out?

64
00:02:45,740 --> 00:02:46,620
再忍5年就搬
Five more years.

65
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,860
能帮点儿忙吗
A little help here?

66
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,599
所以我们才建议你学小提琴
This is why we suggested the violin.

67
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:54,126
大提琴手比较讨大学管弦乐队喜欢
A cello is more in demand in university orchestras.

68
00:02:54,126 --> 00:02:55,800
-你知道什么不讨人喜欢吗 -什么
- You know what's not in demand? - Oh, what?

69
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,616
参加管弦乐团的姑娘
Girls who play in university orchestras.

70
00:02:57,616 --> 00:03:00,060
-来 我帮你提到路边去吧 -给
- Here, I'll help you carry it out to the curb. - Okay. Here.

71
00:03:00,060 --> 00:03:01,560
菲尔 把裤子穿上
Phil, put on some pants.

72
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:04,316
拜托 这裤子比我的泳裤长多了
Come on! This covers up more than my bathing suit.

73
00:03:04,316 --> 00:03:05,600
别提你的泳裤了
And don't remind me.

74
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,760
海莉 亲爱的
Haley, honey-

75
00:03:06,820 --> 00:03:08,939
别忘了 驾校教练会去接你下课
Don't forget, the driving instructor is picking you up from school.

76
00:03:08,939 --> 00:03:10,780
他就不能换个地儿接我吗
Can't he pick me up someplace else?

77
00:03:10,780 --> 00:03:12,401
我可不想让同学以为我在跟一个
I don't want kids at school thinking I'm dating...

78
00:03:12,401 --> 00:03:14,886
40岁又不帅的驾校教练约会
a 40-year-old driving instructor who's not even cute.

79
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:17,020
海莉刚拿到驾驶实习证
Haley just got her learner's permit.

80
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,300
我们轮流陪她开车
We've been taking turns driving with her.

81
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:22,780
最基本的驾驶规则之一
One of the really standard rules of the road...

82
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:24,880
就是要和前面的车
is we want to keep a safe distance

83
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:26,260
保持安全距离
between us and the car in front.

84
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:28,460
-这距离不安全 不安全啊 -对
- And that is not safe right there. Not safe. - Right.

85
00:03:28,628 --> 00:03:29,742
-好 并道 -我
- Okay, merge. - I-

86
00:03:29,860 --> 00:03:33,940
并道 并道 并道并道快并道
Merge. Merge! Merge! Merge! Merge!

87
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:35,386
闭嘴 你再叫我都崩溃了
Stop it! You're freaking me out!

88
00:03:36,539 --> 00:03:39,220
这导航系统乱七八糟的
This navigation system is all messed up.

89
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:40,320
上面说我们开进了一个公园里
It thinks we're in a park.

90
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,663
我的天 还真是一个公园
Oh, my God! It is a park!

91
00:03:42,663 --> 00:03:43,839
-躲开那群孩子 -噢 天啊
- Away from the kids! - Oh, my God!

92
00:03:43,839 --> 00:03:45,023
-朝湖里开 -我该
- Aim for the lake! - I wanted-

93
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:49,080
我们夫妻俩真是命悬一线啊
Makes you realize we're all just hanging by a thread.

94
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:54,220
开学第一天 曼尼最不需要的
The last thing Manny needs on his first day of school...

95
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:56,180
就是你"打计"他的自信心了
is you "undermelting" his confidence.

96
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:58,300
-是打击 -你现在又打击我了
- Undermining. - Now you're doing it to me too.

97
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,000
我很抱歉
I'm sorry,

98
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:01,100
但人们只在两种情况下穿雨披
but there's only two places anyone should wear a poncho-

99
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:04,160
去尼亚加拉大瀑布和玩激流勇进
Niagara Falls and log rides.

100
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,860
你太小题大作了
You think too much about these things.

101
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:08,360
我向来都是随心所欲 穿各种奇装异服
I wear all sort of daring outfits all the time,

102
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:11,099
而别人都很膜拜我 因为我穿出了自信
and people admire them because I wear them with the confidence.

103
00:04:11,099 --> 00:04:14,065
敢情他们膜拜的只是你的自信啊
Yeah, I'm sure it's the confidence they're admiring.

104
00:04:15,620 --> 00:04:19,060
我只是觉得 这有点儿太过分了
I just- i just think it's a little over-the-top.

105
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:20,800
知道吗 你该放松点儿 开心点儿
You know what? You need to loosen up and have fun.

106
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:22,199
我够放了 我够开了
I am loose. I'm fun.

107
00:04:22,199 --> 00:04:24,560
还记得 上周用早餐当晚餐吗
Remember, uh, breakfast for dinner last week?

108
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,300
就是我的主意
My idea.

109
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,260
自从带莉莉回来后你就紧张得要死
Ever since we brought Lily home, you've been tense.

110
00:04:28,380 --> 00:04:31,020
你到处都上了儿童锁 还尽读些育儿书籍
All you do is put child locks on things, read parenting books.

111
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:33,900
你就不能消停一下吗 来抱抱你女儿
Would you please stop and- Here, just hold your daughter.

112
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,398
抱抱她 放松点
Hold her and relax.

113
00:04:36,398 --> 00:04:38,399
-好吧 甜心 来吧 -放轻松
- All right, sweetheart, come on. - Just relax.

114
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:40,357
小甜心
Aw, sweetheart.

115
00:04:41,336 --> 00:04:42,380
你给她喷了发胶吗
Did you put hair spray on this?

116
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:44,078
一点点 我来放点音乐
Just a little bit. I'm gonna put some music on.

117
00:04:44,078 --> 00:04:45,003
不 小卡 我还要去上班
No, Cam, I have to go to work.

118
00:04:45,003 --> 00:04:46,440
-跟她跳跳舞 -别 没时间了
- Dance with her. - Come on, it's not time for this.

119
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,500
我要放舞曲了哦
Put a little boogie in it.

120
00:04:47,726 --> 00:04:48,683
饶了我吧
Oh, come on.

121
00:04:49,247 --> 00:04:51,231
跳吧 你知道这首歌是你的菜
Just dance. You know you love this song.

122
00:04:51,580 --> 00:04:53,020
的确是首好歌
This is actually a really good song.

123
00:04:53,587 --> 00:04:54,743
那好吧 好吧
All right. Okay.

124
00:04:55,359 --> 00:04:57,110
谁才是舞后呢
Who's a dancing queen, huh?

125
00:04:59,140 --> 00:05:00,860
一起摇摆吧
Put a little boogie in it.

126
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:03,060
看 好玩吧 是不是
See? Fun, right?

127
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:05,100
妈呀 撞到她的头了吗
Oh, my- Was that her head?

128
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,640
不 我想要是撞到头 她肯定早就
No, I think if it was her head, she would be-

129
00:05:08,205 --> 00:05:10,840
好吧 是撞到头了 不哭 不哭
Yeah, it was her head. Okay. Okay.

130
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:16,360
没事的 没事的 我知道
Yes. Yes, I know.

131
00:05:16,624 --> 00:05:19,110
我把布布熊冰袋拿来了
I got Boo-boo Bear from the freezer.

132
00:05:20,071 --> 00:05:21,380
你脸上怎么有巧克力
Why do you have chocolate on your face?

133
00:05:21,380 --> 00:05:22,160
布布熊压在派下面了
It was under a pie.

134
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,519
所以你就吃出了一条生路吗
So you ate your way to it?

135
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:25,512
我只能见机行事 你又不帮我
I made a judgment call. You weren't there.

136
00:05:25,512 --> 00:05:28,180
-你看她没事吧 -她哭得没那么凶了
- Do you think she's all right? - She didn't cry that much.

137
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:29,840
也许这不是好兆头呢 你懂的
Maybe that's a bad sign. You know,

138
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:31,318
我们得试着让她笑出来
we should try and make her laugh.

139
00:05:31,318 --> 00:05:33,001
-为什么 -那样我们就知道她没事了
- Why? - 'Cause that's how we'll know she's okay.

140
00:05:33,001 --> 00:05:34,838
那个 狗狗在哪里
Where's... uh... where's Doggy?

141
00:05:34,838 --> 00:05:37,160
狗狗 狗狗 这儿 狗狗
Doggy. Doggy. Here, Doggy.

142
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:39,320
好吧 我来
Okay. There you go.

143
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:43,280
狗不是这么叫的
But it's a dog.

144
00:05:43,340 --> 00:05:44,480
我知道 所以才好笑
Yeah, I know. That's why it's funny.

145
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:47,100
我没觉得有那么好笑
I don't think it's as funny as you think it is.

146
00:05:47,140 --> 00:05:48,380
我们直接打给你姐吧
Can we please just call your sister?

147
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:49,974
不 不 小卡 为什么
No, no. Cam- Cam- - Why?

148
00:05:49,974 --> 00:05:51,860
这样她就可以盛气凌人说三道四了
So she can be all judgmental and condescending,

149
00:05:51,860 --> 00:05:52,820
就好像她是个专家
like she's the expert and

150
00:05:52,820 --> 00:05:54,120
而我根本是育儿白痴
I don't know how to take care of a baby?

151
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:56,200
米奇尔 她是你的家人
Mitchell, she is your family.

152
00:05:56,458 --> 00:05:59,123
她当然会盛气凌人说三道四了
Of course she's gonna be judgmental and condescending.

153
00:06:01,060 --> 00:06:01,395
喂
Hello?

154
00:06:01,395 --> 00:06:04,960
嗨 没什么大事儿 就是想问问
Hey, hi, um- Not a big deal. Just wondering.

155
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:07,260
你家孩子小时候 有没有被你们
When your kids were small, did you ever-

156
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:09,333
怎么说呢 用头撞过墙呢
I don't know- smack their heads into a wall?

157
00:06:09,333 --> 00:06:11,820
一般我们只让他们闭门思过而已
Usually we just gave time-outs.

158
00:06:11,820 --> 00:06:12,940
不 不 是意外撞到
No, no, accidentally.

159
00:06:13,502 --> 00:06:16,240
我们不小心撞到了莉莉的头
Um, we just kind of bonked Lily's head.

160
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,938
撞得不是很重 她也哭得不厉害
It wasn't very hard and she's not acting any differently,

161
00:06:17,938 --> 00:06:19,580
但我还是担心
but I just worry-

162
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:21,180
放松 常有的事啦
Relax. It happens.

163
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:24,198
卢克就老是撞到头 不也好好的
Luke used to bang his head all the time and he's fine.

164
00:06:24,198 --> 00:06:27,780
好吧 谢谢你 真心感激 好的
Okay, all right, thank you. Thanks. That helps. Okay, okay.

165
00:06:27,780 --> 00:06:30,600
我们得带她去看医生 把车开出来
We gotta take her to the doctor. Load up the car.

166
00:06:32,420 --> 00:06:34,880
-歌洛莉亚 -我在这儿
- Gloria? - I'm here.

167
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:39,640
我刚把曼尼送到学校 突然发现
I, uh, just dropped Manny off at school, and I realized...

168
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:42,700
我刚把曼尼送到学校了
I just dropped Manny off at school.

169
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,520
我的妈呀
Oh, boy.

170
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,860
我还以为在你老年痴呆前
And I was hoping we'd still have a few more good years

171
00:06:46,860 --> 00:06:49,240
-我们还能过几年好日子呢 -不 我是说
- before the mind started to go. - No, what I'm saying,

172
00:06:49,940 --> 00:06:52,940
几个月来 我们终于能过过二人世界了
we have the day to ourselves, the first time in months.

173
00:06:52,940 --> 00:06:54,540
我们得好好利用呀
We should take advantage of it.

174
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:55,880
去俱乐部玩玩
Go to the club,

175
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:57,460
吃顿好的
nice lunch,

176
00:06:58,220 --> 00:06:59,280
做做按摩
some massages.

177
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,980
-你的工作呢 -我是老板啊
- What about work? - I'm the boss.

178
00:07:02,760 --> 00:07:05,700
自从娶了你 人家都好奇我居然还去上班
Since I married you, people are surprised I come in at all.

179
00:07:08,006 --> 00:07:09,620
杰很有心思
Jay's very spontaneous.

180
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:13,480
他总能给我惊喜 小礼物啊 度假啊
He's always surprising me with little presents, fun getaways.

181
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:16,240
第一次结婚时 我没怎么尽责
I wasn't the greatest husband the first time around,

182
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,920
不过这次我在努力改进
but I'm trying to do better this time.

183
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:20,920
也许下次结婚 我就能成模范了
And maybe by my third marriage, I'll have it down pat.

184
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:25,420
得 待会儿就得为此付出代价了
Yeah, that one's gonna cost me.

185
00:07:31,010 --> 00:07:32,420
你在看什么书呢
What ya reading there? A book?

186
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,700
对 我老早就想读这本了
Yeah. I've been meaning to get to it for a while.

187
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:36,020
开篇有个地图
Ooh, it's got a map at the beginning.

188
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:37,380
我喜欢这种的
I like it when books do that.

189
00:07:40,010 --> 00:07:41,529
你今早不是要带客人去看房吗
Don't you have an open house this morning?

190
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:42,660
我改时间了
I rescheduled.

191
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:45,000
我想你也许希望我陪陪你
Thought you might like some company.

192
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:49,563
对家庭主妇们来说
Well, the first day of school can be tough

193
00:07:49,563 --> 00:07:50,860
开学第一天肯定无聊至极吧
for stay-at-home moms.

194
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:51,780
因为你不得不适应
Now, you have to understand,

195
00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:54,000
孩子们也走了 巢也空了
the kids are gone, the nest is empty.

196
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,800
她们一下慌了神了
They are rudderless.

197
00:07:57,380 --> 00:07:59,940
而大多数男人都不会注意到这一点
And a lot of guys wouldn't even notice,

198
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:01,660
不过我可不是这样的男人
but I'm not a lot of guys.

199
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:04,040
我总是用心聆听
I listen with my mind,

200
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:06,380
而如果你仔细观察 会发现女人总是
and if you pay attention, women will tell you what they want...

201
00:08:06,380 --> 00:08:09,040
嘴上说一套 心里想另外一套
by telling you the opposite of what they want.

202
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:12,600
有一天 克莱尔说"把你的车挪开点"
Like the other day, Claire was, like, "You have to move your car.

203
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:15,600
"车库里装不下我们俩的车"
There's no space in the garage for both of our cars."

204
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,720
而她其实想说的是
And what she's really saying is that,

205
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,520
也许我该换一辆跑车
you know, I should probably get a sports car.

206
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:23,620
我是想要安静一天的
I was sort of looking forward to a quiet day.

207
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:27,820
读读书 出去跑跑步之类的
Thought I'd just read, maybe go for a run later, that's it.

208
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:29,640
好啊 我们一起去跑步吧
Great. We'll run together.

209
00:08:30,660 --> 00:08:31,900
你不必陪我的
You don't have to do that.

210
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,640
我知道
I know.

211
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:39,260
用心聆听
Listening.

212
00:08:41,380 --> 00:08:42,900
其实呢 我就想一个人跑步
The thing is, I like to run alone.

213
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:45,420
而且我跑得挺快 所以
And I run kinda fast, so-

214
00:08:45,420 --> 00:08:48,680
-所以什么 -所以我不确定你跟得上
- So? - So I'm not sure you're gonna be able to keep up with me.

215
00:08:51,879 --> 00:08:53,844
-你开玩笑的吧 -不是
- You're kid- you're kidding, right? - No.

216
00:08:53,980 --> 00:08:55,260
你真觉得我追不上你吗
You really think I can't keep up with you?

217
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,660
我觉得你都没理解我的意思
I'm not sure you can keep up with this conversation.

218
00:08:56,895 --> 00:08:59,577
你肯定忘了我每天早上都竞走的
I think you're forgetting that I power-walk every morning...

219
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:01,980
还穿着一个医生设计的
and that I wear my special shoes with the big soles,

220
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:03,640
特制厚底健步鞋
which were designed by a doctor.

221
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:08,120
对 我知道 可我每天都跑步
Yes, I know. But I run every day.

222
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:10,860
你真觉得你能跑的和我一样快吗
You really think you can run as fast as me?

223
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:14,180
不 菲尔 我跑起来可远远得
No, Phil, I think I can run much, much faster...

224
00:09:14,180 --> 00:09:16,340
比你快
than you.

225
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,600
砰 就这样 一整天都逆转了
Boom. Just like that, the whole day changed.

226
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,700
杠上了 她知道
It was game on. She knew it.

227
00:09:31,700 --> 00:09:33,480
我知道 我们都知道
I knew it. We both knew it.

228
00:09:34,883 --> 00:09:36,307
我只是想看会儿书
I just wanna read.

229
00:09:37,060 --> 00:09:38,540
我要预约上次帮我按的那个人
I think I'II order what I had the last time.

230
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:39,140
叫什么来着
What was that called?

231
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,940
你只是想让我说出口
You want me to say it

232
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:42,780
-因为你想听我发弹舌R音 -说一个吧
- because you want me to roll my R's. - Come on!

233
00:09:43,237 --> 00:09:44,470
鲁儿宾
Reuben.

234
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:50,520
-杰 这是什么 -可能是旧盖车布吧
- Jay, what is this? - Oh, looks like my old car cover.

235
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:52,476
少来这一套 这是曼尼的斗篷
Don't give me that. This is Manny's poncho.

236
00:09:52,476 --> 00:09:53,720
它怎么在这儿
What is it doing here?

237
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,740
也许在上学路上他突然打算脱了它
Maybe he decided to take it off on the way to school.

238
00:09:56,140 --> 00:09:57,300
你跟他说什么了
What did you say to him?

239
00:09:57,300 --> 00:09:58,980
没什么 我就说了点儿笑话
Nothing. I... told some jokes.

240
00:09:59,270 --> 00:10:01,726
你肯定胡扯了一大篇
You say plenty with your jokes.

241
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:03,280
杰 他很崇拜你的
Jay, he looks up to you.

242
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,800
他那么尊重你的意见
He respects your opinion.

243
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,360
我们是躲过了一劫
We dodged a bullet on this.

244
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:08,040
相信我 我是过来人
Trust me. I've been down this road before.

245
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:09,740
我记得有一次米奇尔
I remember one time Mitchell

246
00:10:09,740 --> 00:10:11,780
决定带着一个搞笑的围巾去上课
decided to wear a jaunty scarf to school.

247
00:10:12,460 --> 00:10:13,620
我什么都没说
I kept my mouth shut.

248
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:15,480
结果他被踢得屁股了开花
He got his jaunty butt kicked.

249
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:18,960
我爸总觉得我从小就挺花枝招展的
My dad has this perception that I was very flamboyant as a kid,

250
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,720
简直是纯属鬼扯
which is just- it's nonsense,

251
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,697
我的同志行为一直都掩藏的超好的
because I kept the whole gay thing very under wraps.

252
00:10:22,697 --> 00:10:24,782
我完全是男人中的男人
You know, I was just a guy's guy.

253
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,160
基本都算是运动健将型了
I was basically a jock.

254
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:28,780
你们懂的
You know?

255
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,980
那我们就该扭曲曼尼的思想
So we should crush Manny's spirit...

256
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:34,800
毁掉他的天性吗
and destroy everything that makes him who he is.

257
00:10:35,180 --> 00:10:36,000
我只是说
I'm just saying,

258
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,540
我可不乐意 看着儿子天天受人欺负
it's no fun to see your kid get picked on every day,

259
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:41,080
被人折磨 就因为他与众不同
getting tormented just because he's different.

260
00:10:41,261 --> 00:10:43,454
现在我跟你说了 你又得伤心了
Now I'm telling you, it rips your heart out.

261
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:46,760
蝙蝠侠也穿着披肩 就没人指责他
Well, Batman doesn't get picked on and he wears a cape.

262
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,740
斗篷不就跟披肩差不多啊
A poncho is just a cape that goes all the way around.

263
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:52,580
蝙蝠侠不受指责 因为他是个大侠
Batman doesn't get picked on because he's a muscular genius.

264
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,800
曼尼连上铺都爬不上去
Manny can't make it to the top bunk.

265
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:56,980
我们要去学校把斗篷给曼尼
We're taking this poncho to Manny at school.

266
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:59,280
必须让他知道 我们是站在他这边的
It's important that he knows we support him.

267
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:04,500
之后我们去做按摩 这主意还不赖
And then we go get those massages, because that sounds good.

268
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:11,720
我一直两步一级地上楼
I always take the stairs two at a time.

269
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,020
想都不用想的
I don't even think about it anymore.

270
00:11:13,380 --> 00:11:15,037
普通人爬楼梯简直弱爆了
The regular way would seem weird.

271
00:11:15,037 --> 00:11:17,329
菲尔 省省吧 我就是比你快
Phil, let it go. I'm faster than you.

272
00:11:17,700 --> 00:11:20,840
有什么办法能一次性解决这个争论就好了
If only there was some way we could settle this once and for all.

273
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:21,800
可该用什么办法呢
But how?

274
00:11:25,562 --> 00:11:27,060
你真想跟我比吗
You seriously wanna race me?

275
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:28,684
我去年可跑了半个马拉松的距离
I ran a half-marathon last year.

276
00:11:28,684 --> 00:11:31,000
我也吓破了半个胆
Wow. I'm half-scared.

277
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:33,240
好吧 确实得比一比 我去换衣服
Okay, we do need to do this. I'll go change.

278
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:36,100
现在不行 我得开个电话会议 会后如何
Not now. I got a conference call. But how about after that?

279
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:38,200
-很好 就今下午 -太棒了
- Great. This afternoon. - Sweet.

280
00:11:40,341 --> 00:11:41,940
两阶一步 两阶一步
Two at a time, two at a ti-

281
00:11:41,940 --> 00:11:43,820
我去 这楼梯得修了
Son of a- Gotta fix that step!

282
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:46,240
两阶一步 顺利登顶
Two at a time! Already at the top, so-

283
00:11:48,107 --> 00:11:51,640
我是缪拉医生 今天由我值班
Hi, I'm Dr. Miura. I'm on call today.

284
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:53,240
看起来我们是撞到了头
Looks like we have a little head bump.

285
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:56,207
对 大概几小时前 撞到在门框上了
Yeah, it happened a couple hours ago on a- on a doorjamb.

286
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,340
我们以前在学校参加过一种课程
We used to do this thing in school...

287
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:02,500
给你一个鸡蛋 你不能把它弄破了
where they would give you an egg and you couldn't break it.

288
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:06,160
这是为了让你体验到为人父母的艰难
And it was supposed to teach you how hard it was to be a parent.

289
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:08,340
但实际上
But the real thing,

290
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:11,420
为人父母比那个难多了
I-it's so much harder. You know?

291
00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:13,260
我在学校也做过这个
We did that in my school too.

292
00:12:13,420 --> 00:12:14,680
结果都不太理想
Didn't turn out so well.

293
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:16,820
我耗费了一打鸡蛋
I went through a dozen eggs.

294
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:18,340
他一紧张就开始吃
Yeah, well, he's a nervous eater.

295
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,920
不 鸡蛋是被我弄破了
No, I broke a dozen eggs.

296
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,540
很抱歉 我只是以为
I'm sorry. I just assumed that-

297
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:25,060
我懂
I know.

298
00:12:26,460 --> 00:12:27,500
我懂你怎么想的
I know what you assumed.

299
00:12:29,620 --> 00:12:30,880
看上去没留什么印迹
There doesn't seem to be any mark.

300
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:34,740
-她头上其实戴了护具 -护具
- Well, her head was somewhat protected. - Protected?

301
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:37,768
-她戴了一个帽子吗 -对 差不多
- Was she wearing a-a hat? - Yes, yes, like a hat.

302
00:12:37,768 --> 00:12:41,503
是假发 时下流行的非洲爆炸头
It was a wig, actually. Sort of a ghetto-fabulous Afro thing.

303
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:44,100
我觉得这有助于诊断
I thought it might be medically relevant.

304
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:44,659
是吗
Really?

305
00:12:44,659 --> 00:12:47,161
你觉得"时下流行"跟诊断有关吗
You thought "Ghetto-fabulous" Might be medically relevant?

306
00:12:48,026 --> 00:12:51,494
-我还是继续检查好了 -好的 谢谢
- Maybe I should just finish with the exam. - Yes, thanks.

307
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:54,120
我想你会很高兴知道我们打算
You'll be pleased to know that Mitchell and I intend on

308
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:57,680
让莉莉从小接触到亚洲文化的氛围
raising Lily with influences from her Asian heritage.

309
00:12:58,420 --> 00:12:59,400
很好啊
That is fantastic.

310
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:02,801
撞到头之后有没有呕吐现象呢
Have you noticed any vomiting since the head bump?

311
00:13:02,801 --> 00:13:04,498
不 不 没有
Uh, no. No, no, no.

312
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:06,940
我们在她房里挂了些东方艺术品
We've hung some art in her room. Some Asian art.

313
00:13:06,940 --> 00:13:08,701
当她可以吃固体食物时
And then when she's ready for solid food,

314
00:13:08,701 --> 00:13:11,096
我们家的拐角处
there's a fantastic pho place...

315
00:13:11,096 --> 00:13:12,363
就有一个超棒的越南米粉店
right around the corner from our house.

316
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:15,640
我发音对吗 是米粉吗
Am I pronouncing that right? Is it pho?

317
00:13:16,940 --> 00:13:17,900
一种汤面
It's a soup.

318
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:20,880
我不知道 我是丹佛人
I don't know. I'm from Denver.

319
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:24,280
我们那儿没有什么 米粉
We don't have a lot of pho there.

320
00:13:25,838 --> 00:13:28,140
再确认一下
Uh, just to be sure,

321
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:30,740
能给我演示一下莉莉撞得有多厉害吗
could you show me how hard Lily got hit?

322
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:32,540
就用你的头
And use your head.

323
00:13:33,070 --> 00:13:37,411
差不多 就像这样
Um, yeah. Really, it was- it was just sorta, like, uh-

324
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:39,140
-懂了吗 -能再来一次吗
- You know? - Could I see that again?

325
00:13:40,426 --> 00:13:42,711
就是 就是撞了一下头 你知道的
Um, it was just- just a head bump, you know.

326
00:13:43,028 --> 00:13:45,351
-那你什么感觉 -还好吧
- How are you feeling? - Uh, fine.

327
00:13:45,780 --> 00:13:47,380
莉莉也这么觉得
So is Lily.

328
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,740
宝宝天生自会应对新手家长
Babies are designed to survive new parents,

329
00:13:50,740 --> 00:13:51,620
所以别担心了
so stop worrying.

330
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:52,840
你们做得很好了
You guys are doing great.

331
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:54,560
谢谢
Thank you.

332
00:13:56,740 --> 00:13:57,260
我是丹佛人
Denver.

333
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:11,320
我没看到哪儿有斗篷
I don't see any ponchos,

334
00:14:11,460 --> 00:14:13,060
说明孩子们要么不会穿斗篷
which means either the kids don't wear them

335
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:15,093
要么穿斗篷的孩子们都被撵走了
or the ones who do wear them disappear.

336
00:14:15,093 --> 00:14:16,934
我们是对的啦
We're doing the right thing.

337
00:14:17,420 --> 00:14:19,120
我无条件支持曼尼
I support Manny no matter what.

338
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:21,080
孩子们需要你的信任
Children need to know that you believe in them.

339
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,920
那非常非常重要
It's the most important thing.

340
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,740
如果你告诉他们 他们有翅膀
If you tell them they have wings,

341
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:26,860
他们就会相信自己能飞上蓝天
they will believe they can fly.

342
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:27,460
噢 是吗
Oh, really?

343
00:14:27,940 --> 00:14:29,900
我认识个老兄 去了伍德斯托克音乐节
I had a buddy, went to Woodstock,

344
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:32,540
坚信自己能飞起来 最后没啥好下场
believed he could fly. Didn't end great.

345
00:14:33,020 --> 00:14:35,260
正因此 酒店的窗户都不敢开了
It's why hotel windows don't open anymore.

346
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:39,340
发生什么事了吗 谁死了
Is something wrong? Who's died?

347
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,160
没人死 曼尼
No one, Manny.

348
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,080
你怎么这么想呢
Why would you even think that?

349
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:42,940
在哥伦比亚的时候
In Colombia,

350
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:45,280
曼尼念巴勃罗埃斯科瓦尔小学
Manny went to Pablo Escobar Elementary School.

351
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,000
如果你从课堂上被叫出来
If you were pulled out of class,

352
00:14:47,020 --> 00:14:49,060
肯定是叫你认尸的
it was definitely to identify a body.

353
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:50,440
好吧 我们把你的斗篷带来了
Well, we got your poncho here.

354
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:52,000
你不是说我穿着它就像
I thought you said it made me look like

355
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,100
我脖子穿了条裙子吗
my neck was wearing a dress.

356
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:54,280
我只是开玩笑的
That was a joke.

357
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:55,740
噢 太好了 还在包里
Oh, good! It's still in the pocket!

358
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,880
-什么还在包里 小家伙 -排箫
- What do you got there, buddy? - My pan flute.

359
00:14:58,040 --> 00:15:00,680
我要给新同学演奏哥伦比亚民俗音乐
I'm going to play some colombian folk music for my new classmates.

360
00:15:01,220 --> 00:15:01,660
不错嘛
Huh. Great.

361
00:15:03,045 --> 00:15:05,420
我真为你骄傲了
I have never been more proud of you.

362
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:07,320
你的朋友们一定会喜欢的
I'm sure your friends are gonna love it.

363
00:15:08,260 --> 00:15:09,540
-把排箫毁掉 -什么
- Break the flute. - What?

364
00:15:09,540 --> 00:15:11,780
斗篷本身没什么
The poncho by itself is fine.

365
00:15:11,900 --> 00:15:14,020
斗篷 加排箫
The poncho, plus the flute,

366
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,500
再加上蠢头蠢脑的舞蹈
plus the stupid dance-

367
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,400
我儿子绝对出师未捷身先死
my son will die a virgin.

368
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:19,360
一语中的
That's right.

369
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:22,100
嘿 给我看看那排箫吧
Hey, sport, can I take a look at that whistle?

370
00:15:23,265 --> 00:15:25,660
噢 天 弄掉了
Oh, geez. Look at that.

371
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:27,540
-而你居然还踩上去了 -什么
- And now you stepped on it! - What?

372
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:31,420
我这是怎么了啊
What's wrong with me?

373
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:35,340
-来 我来开门吧 -谢谢
- Here, let me get it. - Thank you.

374
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:38,080
-也许真的该你来开门 -为什么
- You know, actually, maybe you should do this. - Why?

375
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,879
我不想又把她头撞到门上了
I don't want to bump her head against the door,

376
00:15:39,879 --> 00:15:41,480
或者说 绑安全带的时候夹到她
you know, pinch her with the seat belt.

377
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,460
米奇尔 你还要用这个失误
Mitchell, how long are you gonna beat

378
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:43,720
折磨自己多久
yourself up over one mistake?

379
00:15:43,957 --> 00:15:46,260
又要像上次"挑染金发"事件一样吗
Is this going to be like the blond highlights all over again?

380
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:49,060
我只是觉得我这个父亲当得很失败
I just- I think I suck at being a father.

381
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:52,020
你在说什么呢 我们还是新手爸爸
What are you talking about? We're new at this.

382
00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:53,960
对 可你简直是天生的好父亲 你看你
Yeah, but you're such a natural. I mean, look at you.

383
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:56,561
你一进屋她就来精神了
You walk into the room and she lights up.

384
00:15:56,561 --> 00:15:59,265
你一只手就能给她换尿片 而我
Y-You change her diaper with one hand. I-

385
00:15:59,488 --> 00:16:01,515
好吧 我其实是在嫉妒你
Nice. I-I'm actually jealous of you.

386
00:16:01,660 --> 00:16:04,320
也有好多事儿你行我不行呢
There are so many things that you do that I can't.

387
00:16:04,679 --> 00:16:06,980
你把整个屋子都做好了幼儿防护
Y-You baby-proofed the entire house.

388
00:16:06,980 --> 00:16:08,740
你把所有的领养文件都处理得有条不紊
You took care of all the adoption paperwork.

389
00:16:09,220 --> 00:16:11,420
要没你 我们都没有宝宝可撞
Without you, we wouldn't even have a baby to injure.

390
00:16:11,620 --> 00:16:12,840
只是一些表格而已
Just a couple of forms.

391
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,420
好吧 确实是一大堆表格
Actually, that was a lot of paperwork.

392
00:16:14,540 --> 00:16:16,358
你还挤进了所有幼儿园的候选名单
And you got her on all those preschool waiting lists.

393
00:16:16,358 --> 00:16:18,840
不然呢 难道要等到她年龄"足够大"
Can't believe you were gonna wait until she was "old enough."

394
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:20,980
看到没 所以我们才是超棒的一队啊
You see, that's what makes us a great team.

395
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,960
我们各有所长
We each have our own strengths.

396
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:27,080
-快说 谁是超棒奶爸 -我们
- Now, who are amazing parents? - We are.

397
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:29,140
-我听不见 -我们
- I can't hear you. - We are!

398
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:30,880
-可别忘了 -好啦
- Don't you forget it. - Okay.

399
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:36,460
我们是不是把宝宝锁在车里了
Did we just lock our baby in the car?

400
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:37,720
你把钥匙放在包里了吗
Did you put the keys in the bag?

401
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:38,520
我把钥匙放在包里了
I put the keys in the bag.

402
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:39,180
米奇尔
Oh, Mitchell,

403
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:40,820
我说过不要把钥匙放在包里的嘛
I told you not to put the keys in the bag!

404
00:16:41,420 --> 00:16:42,640
拜托 别抓狂
Come on! Don't freak out!

405
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:43,980
莉莉 没事的
Lily, it's okay!

406
00:16:43,980 --> 00:16:45,420
*A-B-C-D-E-F-*
*A-B-C-D-E-F-*

407
00:16:45,420 --> 00:16:46,540
有没有搞错 你还跟她唱歌
What, are you singing to her?

408
00:16:46,660 --> 00:16:48,520
人们会为此被逮捕的
People get arrested for this, Mitchell.

409
00:16:49,449 --> 00:16:52,020
*H-I-J-K-L-M-N-O-P*
*H-I-J-K-L-M-N-O-P*

410
00:16:52,020 --> 00:16:53,940
-四个门都锁上了吗 -带手机了吗
- Do all four doors lock? - Do you have a phone?

411
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:55,380
什么
What?

412
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,039
我什么都没说
I didn't say anything.

413
00:16:58,039 --> 00:17:00,124
我听不到你讲话 我在享受混搭专辑
Couldn't hear ya. I'm cranking one of my mash-ups.

414
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:03,980
他们回来了
There they are.

415
00:17:04,355 --> 00:17:06,680
重回监狱第一天感觉如何
How was the first day back in prison?

416
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:07,760
-还不错 -嗯
- Fine. - Yep

417
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:11,260
你们俩在搞什么啊
What are you guys doing?

418
00:17:11,740 --> 00:17:13,321
你妈和我要赛跑呢
Your mom and I are racing

419
00:17:13,321 --> 00:17:15,641
从这到红杉树那儿的信箱往返一圈
to the mailbox on Sequoia and back.

420
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:17,700
-为什么 -我也不懂
- Why? - I don't know.

421
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:18,620
她当然懂的
Oh, she knows.

422
00:17:19,580 --> 00:17:22,120
老弟 等我大获全胜之后
Hey, buddy. Soon as I'm done kicking a little Mom butt here,

423
00:17:22,120 --> 00:17:23,600
我陪你练练马里奥赛车如何
how about I school you in some Mario Kart?

424
00:17:23,820 --> 00:17:25,540
不行 还得赶日记呢
Can't. Gotta work on my journal.

425
00:17:25,760 --> 00:17:26,200
真没劲
Lame!

426
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:29,000
艾丽克斯 你呢
Hey, uh, Alex. You?

427
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,860
我要做历史卷子
Uh, I have a history paper.

428
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:33,600
好吧 如果你想小小见证一下历史诞生
Well, if you wanna see a little history being made right here-

429
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:34,700
-没兴趣 -好吧
- Not really. - Okay.

430
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:39,340
-准备好了吗 -你呢
- Ready? - Are you?

431
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:40,260
我生来就准备好了
I was born ready.

432
00:17:40,646 --> 00:17:43,855
-我打娘胎就长着小金翅膀 -开始
- I came outta the womb wearing tiny little golden wings- - go!

433
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:47,280
我来打碎玻璃
I'm breaking the window!

434
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:49,219
紧急援助中心 我叫崔娜
Emergency assistance. This is Trina.

435
00:17:49,219 --> 00:17:51,220
帮帮忙 我们把宝宝锁在车里了
Help! We I- We locked our baby in the car

436
00:17:51,220 --> 00:17:52,420
人们正对着我们唧唧歪歪呢
and people are judging us!

437
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:54,200
我对天发誓 一定要砸碎它
I swear to God, I'm gonna break it!

438
00:17:54,220 --> 00:17:56,200
别把玻璃砸碎 玻璃会扎到她的
Do not break the window! You'll get glass on her!

439
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:57,620
先生 请让你夫人冷静
Sir, please tell your wife to relax.

440
00:17:57,740 --> 00:17:59,560
-一切都会好的 -他是个男的
- Everything is going to be okay. - That's a man.

441
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:00,060
真的吗
Really?

442
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:03,200
别怕 莉莉 爹地来救你了
Don't worry, Lily! Daddy's coming for you!

443
00:18:03,300 --> 00:18:04,400
先生 我们刚发送了信号
Sir, we just sent the signal.

444
00:18:04,520 --> 00:18:06,480
-车门应该已经解锁了 -试试车门
- The door should be unlocked now. - Check- Check the door.

445
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:09,380
-试试车门 试试车门 -没有开啊
- Check the door. Check the door. - It's not unlocked!

446
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:11,660
好了
Okay.

447
00:18:11,900 --> 00:18:14,460
真不可思议 他们怎么做到的
That is amazing. How did they do that?

448
00:18:14,580 --> 00:18:16,280
不知道 我们搞定了
I don't know. It's just- We got it.

449
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:17,640
-谢谢 -难不成是天外来客
- Thank you. - Did that come from space?

450
00:18:18,040 --> 00:18:19,800
我每天跑5英里
I run five miles a day.

451
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,940
我的静止心率每分钟48次
I have a resting heart rate of 48.

452
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:24,062
就2英里的赛跑 我没可能会输给
There is no way I'm going to lose

453
00:18:24,062 --> 00:18:26,313
这个天天撑着约翰尼滑雪杆竞走的家伙
a two-mile race to Johnny Ski Pole.

454
00:18:29,220 --> 00:18:32,700
我这是节省体力 准备来个一举攻坚
Saving my energy, drafting off of you.

455
00:18:33,980 --> 00:18:35,360
你现在特骄傲是吧
You feeling cocky?

456
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,400
对啊 我就是
Yeah, I am.

457
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:40,240
正中下怀
Love it.

458
00:18:40,428 --> 00:18:44,139
但当我看到那件T恤后 我突然明白了
But after seeing that T-shirt, I realized something.

459
00:18:46,100 --> 00:18:49,320
开学第一天对我的孩子们来说都不好过
The first day of school is tough on all my kids,

460
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,600
尤其是我嫁的这个男人
especially the one I married.

461
00:18:54,158 --> 00:18:56,650
内燃机启动啦
Afterburners engaged!

462
00:18:57,100 --> 00:19:00,420
别被尾烟呛到哦
Whoo! Don't choke on my smoke!

463
00:19:01,053 --> 00:19:03,209
我要完成冲刺了
And down the stretch he goes.

464
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:05,660
难以置信啊
I don't believe it!

465
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:09,440
老爸赢了 相信奇迹吗
Daddy wins! Do you believe in miracles?

466
00:19:09,642 --> 00:19:12,160
美利坚万岁 美利
U.S.A., u.S. -

467
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:13,620
-噢 不 -噢 上帝啊
- Oh, no! - Oh, Jesus!

468
00:19:15,460 --> 00:19:17,162
天呐 刚刚那是什么
Oh, my- What was that?

469
00:19:17,162 --> 00:19:18,260
-是个人吗 -我没事
- Was that a person? - I'm good!

470
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:19,781
-爸爸 -我没事
- Dad? - I'm good.

471
00:19:19,781 --> 00:19:21,919
-亲爱的 你还好吗 -我没事
- Honey, are you okay? - I'm good. Whoo!

472
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:24,260
你有进步哦 宝贝
You're getting better, sweetheart.

473
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:30,380
我是故意输掉让他开心点的吗
Did I lose the race to make him feel better?

474
00:19:31,220 --> 00:19:31,740
也许吧
Maybe.

475
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:36,360
但在今天 他需要这一场胜利
But it just seemed like he could use a win today.

476
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:44,900
我们常常为了深爱的人做些稀奇古怪的事
We do strange things for the people we love.

477
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:47,860
我们对他们撒谎 我们为他们撒谎
We lie to them, we lie for them.

478
00:19:51,740 --> 00:19:53,700
或许生活中难免坎坷颠簸
There may be some bumps along the way,

479
00:19:54,300 --> 00:19:57,100
但我们总希望他们过得尽善尽美
but we never stop wanting the best for them.

480
00:19:57,100 --> 00:20:00,208
就像是肩负着最沉重的负担
That's what makes it such a tough job.

481
00:20:01,940 --> 00:20:04,840
但却是世上最甜蜜的负担
Kind of the best job in the world.

482
00:20:07,194 --> 00:20:08,420
-你在干嘛 -好好看路
- What are you doing? - Turn your eyes on the road!

483
00:20:08,420 --> 00:20:09,770
-天呐 -天呐
- Oh, my God! - Oh, my God!

484
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:18,200
-好吧 -好吧
- Okay. - Okay.

485
00:20:18,460 --> 00:20:19,520
没事 宝贝 这很正常
All right, sweetie, this happens.

486
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:21,420
保持冷静 这是首要的
Remain calm. That's the first thing.

487
00:20:21,420 --> 00:20:22,000
就停在这儿吧 我来拿证件
Pull over right here. I'll get out the registration.

488
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:24,483
妈妈 我不喜欢警察
Mom, I don't like cops.

489
00:20:24,483 --> 00:20:25,520
没事儿 停下来
Ok, pull over right there.

490
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:26,260
我不喜欢警察
I don't like cops.

491
00:20:26,300 --> 00:20:27,520
没事儿 这儿有个空位
All right, there's a space right here...

492
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:28,457
-我不停下来 就不 -你必须停下
- I can't pull over. No, I can't. - You need to pull over!

493
00:20:28,457 --> 00:20:30,804
-你可以不停 我赞成 -菲尔
- No can do. No can do! - Phil!

494
00:20:30,804 --> 00:20:32,183
-我有先例 -我在加速了
- I got priors. - I'm speeding up.

495
00:20:32,183 --> 00:20:32,860
菲尔 你
Phil, you-

496
00:20:32,860 --> 00:20:34,300
刚刚那商场要收停车费
Parking ticket from the mall.

497
00:20:34,540 --> 00:20:35,900
我从不交停车费的
I never paid the parking ticket.

498
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:36,979
继续开 宝贝
Keep moving, sweetheart.

499
00:20:36,979 --> 00:20:38,449
老爸支持我 我可以加速了
Dad's with me, I can speed up and-

500
00:20:38,449 --> 00:20:40,659
你以为拍电影啊海莉 停车
It's not a movie, Hayley, and pull over!
